  "solution_steps": [
    "解：∵四边形ABCD是菱形，",
    "∴AB＝BC＝CD＝AD，∠D＝∠ABC＝60°，",
    "∴△ABC，△ACD是等边三角形，",
    "∴∠BCE＝∠ACD＝60°，BC＝AC，",
    "∴∠CBE+∠BEC＝180°﹣60°＝120°，",
    "∵∠BEF＝120°，",
    "∴∠CEF+∠BEC＝120°，",
    "∴∠CEF＝∠CBE，",
    "∵∠ECF＝∠BCE，",
    "∴△CEF∽△CBE，",
    "∴CF：CE＝CE：BC，",
    "∵〔图1〕，",
    "∴令AE＝x，则EC＝2x，",
    "∴AC＝x+2x＝3x，",
    "∴BC＝AC＝3x，",
    "∴CF：2x＝2x：3x，",
    "∴CF＝〔图2〕x，",
    "∴DF＝3x﹣〔图2〕x＝〔图3〕x，",
    "∴〔图4〕＝〔图5〕．",
    "故选：D．",
    "〔图6〕"
  ],
